     "build/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/implement-projectlock-normalization-and-constraint-resolution",
     :path "specs/build-workflow/tasks.md",
     :role :dependency-selection-producer,
     :criterion-text
     "Real dependency resolution with conflict, profile and capability rejection. Apply declared yank/revocation policy to selection and installation; retain signature/revocation status in locked records and explain each policy decision without silently replacing or erasing locked history. Reject revoked packages unless policy explicitly permits historical rebuild, and report revoked/yanked rejection with PKG5006. For [SAFE14](../../docs/phase-02-safety/043-safe14-supply-chain-safety.md), reject conflicting package safety manifests before compiling dependents; require safe/release locks and validate native source/digest/ABI/target/link/license/wrapper/capability metadata. Compute and present transitive authority diffs including build/runtime, unsafe, plugins, model/tool/secret and generated artifacts; dependency updates cannot silently expand grants. Caller policy checks unsafe summaries, expired reviews and safe exported wrappers/certificates. Apply advisory affected/patched-version, compatibility and capability policy at selection and installation. Reject policy violations without granting undeclared authority. Preserve existing reproducible locks and historical artifacts unless explicit emergency policy applies.",
